{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2021-12-29 18:20:00', 'title': 'INTEL SELLS SSD BUSINESS AND DALIAN FACILITY TO SK HYNIX', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTEL CORP. COMPLETES ITS FIRST CLOSING IN THE SALE OF ITS NAND AND SSD BUSINESS TO SK HYNIX.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2021-12-29 18:15:00', 'title': 'SK HYNIX COMPLETES THE FIRST PHASE OF INTEL NAND AND SSD BUSINESS ACQUISITION', 'text': 'SK HYNIX HAS ACQUIRED INTEL\'S SSD BUSINESS AND DALIAN NAND FLASH MANUFACTURING FACILITY ASSETS IN CHINA THE NEW ENTITY WILL BE BRANDED "SOLIDIGM" WITH THE SYNERGY OF THE COMBINED BUSINESS PORTFOLIO, SK HYNIX AIMS TO BECOME GLOBAL 1ST TIER TECHNOLOGY COMPANY. SEOUL, SOUTH KOREA, DEC. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SK HYNIX INC. (OR \'THE COMPANY\', WWW.SKHYNIX.COM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE FIRST PHASE OF THE TRANSACTION TO ACQUIRE INTEL\'S NAND AND SOLID-STATE DRIVE (SSD) BUSINESS.'}